SOLUTION 1
    temp      20
    pH        7 charge
    units     mmol/kgw
    C(4)      50

SOLUTION 2
    temp      20
    pH        7 charge
    units     mmol/kgw
    Ca        50

MIX 1
    1 1
    2 1

